      { text: `Mommy came back inside and both girls ran to her.\n\n"Daddy said sorry," Katie reported.\n\n"I know," Mommy said, smiling.\n\n"Was it a good sorry?"\n\n"It was a very good sorry."\n\nKatie nodded with deep satisfaction. "Good."\n\nThat night Daddy told them: "Watch how Mommy and I treat each other. The way we love each other teaches you how to love people. We won't always get it right — but we'll always go back and make it right. That I promise you."\n\n"That's a good promise," Ellie said.\n\n"I intend to keep it," Daddy said. 🌟`, emoji: "🌟", gradient: "linear-gradient(160deg, #1a4e1a 0%, #2a7e2a 40%, #1a6e1a 100%)" }
