    prayer: "Dear Jesus,\n\nThank You for forgiving us. Every time. No matter what.\n\nHelp Ellie Girl and Katers grow up in a home where sorry is never too hard to say — because they've watched Mommy and Daddy say it and mean it.\n\nHelp them be quick to forgive and quick to ask for forgiveness.\n\nJust like You are with us.\n\nWe love You.\n\nAmen. 🙏"
